OL,3,GNEWSAMeet the Manx Bard 'mixing poetry
OL,4,Awith pop culture'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Isle of Man's new Manx Bard,
OL,7,FDeclan, has said his poetry "focuses on
OL,8,Fthe quirks of pop culture" as well as
OL,9,Fdrawing from Manx folk culture and
OL,10,Fhistory.
OL,12,FDeclan told the BBC his work was
OL,13,F"generally written to be performed
OL,14,Frather than read", adding: "I
OL,15,Fspeak-sing my poetry, which is
OL,16,Fbasically my territory."
OL,18,FHe said he was looking forward to
OL,19,Fperforming at Manx Litfest this
OL,20,Fweekend, as part of the Celebration of
OL,21,FPoetry.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
