OL,3,GNEWSAMeet the Manx Bard 'mixing poetry
OL,4,Awith pop culture'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeclan was installed as the 12th person
OL,7,Fto hold the role in September, a post
OL,8,Fthat has existed on the Island since
OL,9,F2014.
